+# Activities
+
+Activities describe what happened in the account, such as cards being added, assigned, moved, or renamed, and comments being posted. They are the same events shown in the account timeline, with two differences: deprecated collection changes are omitted, and title changes are included.
+
+## `GET /:account_slug/activities`
+
+Returns a paginated list of activities on boards the current user can access, newest first.
+
+__Query Parameters:__
+
+| Parameter | Description |
+|-----------|-------------|
+| `creator_ids[]` | Filter by the ID(s) of the user who performed the activity |
+| `board_ids[]` | Filter by board ID(s) |
+
+Repeated `creator_ids[]` values are ORed together, and so are repeated `board_ids[]` values. The two filters combine with AND.
+
+Example:
+- `creator_ids[]=03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7&board_ids[]=03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm` — activity by one user on one board
+
