+
+Each activity has these fields:
+
+| Field | Description |
+|-------|-------------|
+| `id` | The activity ID |
+| `action` | The kind of activity, such as `card_assigned` or `comment_created` |
+| `created_at` | When the activity happened |
+| `description` | A plain-text description of the activity. Names and titles are HTML-escaped (for example, `&quot;`), and the wording can depend on the current user, such as when a card is assigned to them |
+| `particulars` | Details specific to the action (see below) |
+| `url` | For card activities, the card. For comment activities, the card where the comment was posted, anchored to that comment |
+| `eventable_type` | `Card` or `Comment` |
+| `eventable` | The card or comment the activity is about, using the same representation as the [Cards](cards.md) or [Comments](comments.md) sections |
+| `board` | The board the activity happened on |
+| `creator` | The user who performed the activity |
+
+Possible values for `action`: `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned`, `card_published`, `card_closed`, `card_reopened`, `card_board_changed`, `card_postponed`, `card_auto_postponed`, `card_title_changed`, `card_triaged`, `card_sent_back_to_triage`, `comment_created`.
+
+__Particulars:__
+
+| Action | `particulars` |
+|--------|---------------|
+| `card_assigned`, `card_unassigned` | `assignee_ids`: the IDs of the users assigned or unassigned |
+| `card_board_changed` | `old_board`, `new_board`: the names of the boards the card moved from and to |
+| `card_title_changed` | `old_title`, `new_title`: the card's title before and after the rename |
+| `card_triaged` | `column`: the name of the column the card was moved into |
+| All other actions | An empty object (`{}`) |
+
+When a board, title, or column name is missing, its value is an empty string.
diff --git a/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb b/test/controllers/activities_controller_test.rb
